# Parhelion II (cast on turn 1 for 8 with Black Lotus and the five Moxen): on turn 3 She-Hulk (power exactly 4) crews it (Crew 4)
# and it attacks. Its trigger makes two 4/4 white Angels with flying and vigilance that are attacking, and the Angels were
# never declared as attackers (ruling 2019-05-03): Bot2's life is 20 - 5 (Parhelion II) - 4 - 4 = 7. Vigilance keeps Parhelion II
# and both Angels untapped; the keywords are shown on the Vehicle and on the tokens. Bot2 controls no creature, so each
# Angel can only attack Bot2 and no choice is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Parhelion II
She-Hulk, Jade Defender
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

